!  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 369"; the heading row's LOCATION field is 235015,
! line 1's word (docs/transcription_workflow.md step 1).
!
! THE PAGE.  Contiguous from 235015.40 (line 1) to 235062.00 (line 52,
! a half word; next 235062.40), then blank paper.  Every line number
! prints a "*"; a "*" after the LOCATION on lines 7, 22 and 42.  No
! SLC, no TAIL, no change of PUNID or card series.
!   line  31     remark card ("-" in NAME, blank).
!   line  32     remark banner "-****** UNIT AND CHANNEL REQUEST ******".
!   line   7     Z XW CV XW,$L,3.0 prints 000010.00+ 000 000003 000000.
!
! EXTERNALS (every one checked against landed decks and staging):
!   resident (landed p.99 / p.103, forms copied): SXCHAN, SCHANK (p.103
!     "SCHANK SYN(BU,18), SXCHAN+.28" in its DEFINING form), SUNITK,
!     SCHOP, SMULTI, SSEL, SMOUNT, SCNFCG (stand-in form as the landed
!     decks write it).
!   SCOMD, NOT LANDED, values READ OFF THE DEFINING PAGES' INK (printed
!     p.363 PDF p.113 lines 33-50; printed p.376 PDF p.126 lines 4-13):
!     JFLDB  "J FLD B DRZ,(12)" at 234560.00          (p.363 line 33)
!     JXMSK  "J XMSK SYN,$X13"  prints 000035.00+     (p.363 line 40)
!     JOP 2.0, JSR 4.0, JJ1 8.0, JJ4 16.0, JOV 32.0, JNV 64.0,
!     JON 128.0  ("J OP" .. "J ON" SYN,n.0, p.363 lines 44-50)
!     ZADD, ZALL "(AX)DDI(BU,18,6),ADDX / ALLX" print +00616464 /
!       +00614343 BU,22,06 (p.376 lines 4-5): DDI is not implemented,
!       stood in as SYN(BU,18,6), integer, as p.226's VD15.
!     ZREQUN "Z REQ UN SYN,$6", ZREQCH "Z REQ CH SYN,$8" (p.376
!       lines 8, 10).
!     $PG0 is a system symbol ("Z SCN P2 SYN,$PG0" prints 000013.51+
!       on p.376 line 13); this page's "$PGO" (line 18) is $PG0.
!   SCOMD, NOT LANDED, value from THIS PAGE'S BINARY only (plain SYN):
!     ZEREX1, ZEREX2, JNOPX, ZCONVC, ZDSKCH, ZCHONY, ZCHON2, RMOVE.
!   ZIOCH is DEFINED here (line 8, 235023.00) -- p.361's stand-in
!   "ZIOCH SYN,(8)235023.0" agrees.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 8 label prints "ZICCH": ZIOCH (p.361 line 33 B,ZIOCH prints
!     235023.10, this card's own location; open O).
!   * line 16 "JCP" = JOP: p.363 line 44 defines "J OP SYN,2.0
!     -OPERATOR", the remark here is "-TEST IF OPERATOR SOURCE", and the
!     binary 000002.00 is 2.0.  No JCP anywhere.
!   * line 18 "$PGO" = $PG0 (system pseudo-op symbol; binary 000013.51
!     is $PG0's address per p.376 line 13).
!   * line 42 "Z ACT ON" = ZACTON (line 45's label); line 22 "Z COMP C"
!     = ZCOMPC; "Z REQ CH"/"ZREQ CH"/"Z REQ UN" = ZREQCH/ZREQUN;
!     "SMCUNT" (line 46) = SMOUNT (p.99; open O).
!   * CTIC010/CTICO10 on lines 10-16 = CTI0010 (connective digits).
!   * hex byte printed "CO" on line 5 (B,$) = 00 (B assembles 00); the
!     "C0" on the BZRZ rows (lines 17, 47) is a real C0 and "C2" on
!     BRZ/BAE rows a real C2 (the statements assemble them).
!
! CARD SERIALS.  WA000387 .. WA000436; WA000406 prints on BOTH lines 20
